# Build-time-only files for the static site templating system (build.py /
# test_build.py / partials/ / pages/). These are source inputs to build.py,
# not meant to be served — the *output* of build.py (root-level index.html,
# about.html, etc.) is what nginx actually serves.
#
# NOTE: scoped narrowly to only the new files added by the header/footer/
# support-modal partials refactor. Pre-existing repo contents (bot/, api/,
# .git, *.md) were already being copied into the image before this file
# existed and are left untouched here — that's a separate pre-existing
# question, not part of this change.
partials/
pages/
build.py
test_build.py
kpf.md
